{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 12,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoever loveth instruction loveth knowledge: but he that hateth reproof ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " brutish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A good ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " obtaineth favor from the LORD: but a man of wicked devices he will condemn.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A man shall not be established by wickedness: but the root of the righteous shall not be moved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A virtuous woman ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a crown to her husband: but she that maketh ashamed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as rottenness in his bones.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The thoughts of the righteous ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " right: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "but",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the counsels of the wicked ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " deceit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The words of the wicked ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to lie in wait for blood: but the mouth of the upright shall deliver them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked are overthrown, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not: but the house of the righteous shall stand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A man shall be commended according to his wisdom: but he that is of a perverse heart shall be despised.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " despised, and hath a servant, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " better than he that honoreth himself, and is destitute of bread.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A righteous ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " regardeth the life of his beast: but the tender mercies of the wicked ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cruel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that tilleth his land shall be satisfied with bread: but he that followeth vain ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "persons is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " void of understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked desireth the net of evil ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": but the root of the righteous yieldeth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "fruit",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked is snared by the transgression of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lips: but the just shall come out of trouble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A man shall be satisfied with good by the fruit of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " mouth: and the recompense of a man's hands shall be rendered to him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The way of a fool ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " right in his own eyes: but he that hearkeneth to counsel ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wise.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A fool's wrath is presently known: but a prudent ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " covereth shame.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " speaketh truth showeth forth righteousness: but a false witness, deceit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is that speaketh like the piercings of a sword: but the tongue of the wise ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " health.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The lip of truth shall be established for ever: but a lying tongue ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " but for a moment.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Deceit ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the heart of them that imagine evil: but to the counselors of peace ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " joy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There shall no evil happen to the just: but the wicked shall be filled with mischief.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lying lips ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " abomination to the LORD: but they that deal truly ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his delight.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A prudent man concealeth knowledge: but the heart of fools proclaimeth foolishness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The hand of the diligent shall bear rule: but the slothful shall be under tribute.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Heaviness in the heart of man depresseth it: but a good word maketh it glad.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " more excellent than his neighbor: but the way of the wicked seduceth them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The slothful ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " roasteth not that which he took in hunting: but the substance of a diligent man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " precious.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.12.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.12.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In the way of righteousness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " life; and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the path ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of it there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
